---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /anotasi/index.html
title: Indeks Anotasi
description: Semua paragraf Psychological Types yang sudah dianotasi, diurutkan sesuai kemunculannya di buku.
---
<div class="page page--wide">
  <header class="chapter-header">
    <p class="chapter-header__symbol">Catatan pembaca</p>
    <h1>Indeks Anotasi</h1>
    <div class="chapter-header__meta">
      <span>{{ annotatedIndex.length }} paragraf dianotasi</span>
      <span>·</span>
      <span>diurutkan sesuai urutan di buku</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  {% if annotatedIndex.length == 0 %}
  <div class="empty-state empty-state--inline">
    Belum ada anotasi yang ditulis. Tambahkan berkas markdown di
    <code>src/_annotations/cw6/&lt;bab&gt;/p&lt;nomor&gt;.md</code> untuk memulai —
    lihat contoh di <code>src/_annotations/cw6/intro/p000.md</code>.
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if annotatedIndex.length > 0 %}
  <div class="annot-toolbar">
    <div class="annot-search">
      <span class="annot-search__icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg>
      </span>
      <input type="search" id="annot-filter" placeholder="Cari anotasi — paragraf, bab, atau isi anotasi…" aria-label="Cari anotasi" data-annot-filter>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="annot-count" data-annot-count>
    Menampilkan {{ annotatedIndex.length }} dari {{ annotatedIndex.length }} anotasi.
  </p>

  <ul class="annot-list">
    {% for entry in annotatedIndex %}
    <li class="annot-entry" id="{{ entry.slug }}"
        data-search="{{ entry.num }} {{ entry.chapterTitle }} {{ entry.slug }} {{ entry.annotationHtml | excerpt(500) }}">
      <p class="annot-entry__meta">
        <a href="{{ ('/cw6/' + entry.chapterId + '/' + entry.slug + '/') | url }}">
          {% if entry.symbol %}<span class="annot-entry__symbol">{{ entry.symbol }}.</span>{% endif %}
          §{{ entry.num }}
          <span class="annot-entry__chapter">— {{ entry.chapterTitle }}</span>
        </a>
      </p>
      <p class="annot-entry__source">{{ entry.paragraphHtml | excerpt(200) }}</p>
      <div class="annotation">
        {{ entry.annotationHtml | safe }}
      </div>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {% endif %}
</div>
